    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Siege</strong> is an online co-op game where ordinary warriors take on colossal Beasts. In a medieval fantasy world without magic, they rely on gunpowder technology for explosive recoil jumps, gunpowder-powered hammer strikes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the next generation of gaming with fully physics-driven interactive combat and seamless network synchronization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement of the gigantic Beasts reacts to player actions through real-time physics interactions, allowing them to overcome obstacles naturally and create lifelike motion never seen before in any game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Colossal Beast and Smash Its Head!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/b9fc4372f6ca6c4f346c986dd36dc07f.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/b9fc4372f6ca6c4f346c986dd36dc07f.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/b9fc4372f6ca6c4f346c986dd36dc07f.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the giant beast by stepping on its legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the explosive recoil from your hammer to launch yourself into the air and land a powerful blow to its head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >True Physics, Real Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/896b7c09aeb2eca3f87b52349cff2af0.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/896b7c09aeb2eca3f87b52349cff2af0.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/896b7c09aeb2eca3f87b52349cff2af0.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right cheek. Chin. Left cheek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each strike sends the beast\u2019s head snapping to the side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t an animation. It\u2019s real physics, in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Devastating Blow \u2014 Can You Handle It?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/6f6eefd3f1bbe7bef15489c6ea3c55d7.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/6f6eefd3f1bbe7bef15489c6ea3c55d7.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/6f6eefd3f1bbe7bef15489c6ea3c55d7.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One swing of the beast\u2019s tail is all it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit, and you\u2019re sent flying\u2014no time to react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge early, or block with everything you've got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Can Stop It\u2014If You Work Together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/cb8c8cd8da5c5d31e618ee1e56a351c4.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/cb8c8cd8da5c5d31e618ee1e56a351c4.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/cb8c8cd8da5c5d31e618ee1e56a351c4.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough hands, you can pin the beast down using harpoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t last long. Finish the job before they snap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Moment the Beast's Leg Is Trapped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/8abb0a5281ca47c8f1743b8ff4eb71a6.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/8abb0a5281ca47c8f1743b8ff4eb71a6.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/8abb0a5281ca47c8f1743b8ff4eb71a6.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the beast is caught in a trap, it can no longer use that leg properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t last long\u2014finish the fight before the trap breaks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all this incredible gameplay in online co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support us by adding to your wishlist and following the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Siege</strong> is an online co-op game where ordinary warriors take on colossal Beasts. In a medieval fantasy world without magic, they rely on gunpowder technology for explosive recoil jumps, gunpowder-powered hammer strikes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the next generation of gaming with fully physics-driven interactive combat and seamless network synchronization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement of the gigantic Beasts reacts to player actions through real-time physics interactions, allowing them to overcome obstacles naturally and create lifelike motion never seen before in any game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Colossal Beast and Smash Its Head!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/b9fc4372f6ca6c4f346c986dd36dc07f.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/b9fc4372f6ca6c4f346c986dd36dc07f.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/b9fc4372f6ca6c4f346c986dd36dc07f.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the giant beast by stepping on its legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the explosive recoil from your hammer to launch yourself into the air and land a powerful blow to its head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >True Physics, Real Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/896b7c09aeb2eca3f87b52349cff2af0.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/896b7c09aeb2eca3f87b52349cff2af0.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/896b7c09aeb2eca3f87b52349cff2af0.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right cheek. Chin. Left cheek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each strike sends the beast\u2019s head snapping to the side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t an animation. It\u2019s real physics, in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Devastating Blow \u2014 Can You Handle It?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/6f6eefd3f1bbe7bef15489c6ea3c55d7.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/6f6eefd3f1bbe7bef15489c6ea3c55d7.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/6f6eefd3f1bbe7bef15489c6ea3c55d7.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One swing of the beast\u2019s tail is all it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit, and you\u2019re sent flying\u2014no time to react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge early, or block with everything you've got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Can Stop It\u2014If You Work Together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/cb8c8cd8da5c5d31e618ee1e56a351c4.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/cb8c8cd8da5c5d31e618ee1e56a351c4.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/cb8c8cd8da5c5d31e618ee1e56a351c4.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough hands, you can pin the beast down using harpoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t last long. Finish the job before they snap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Moment the Beast's Leg Is Trapped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/8abb0a5281ca47c8f1743b8ff4eb71a6.poster.avif?t=1743602461\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/8abb0a5281ca47c8f1743b8ff4eb71a6.webm?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576380/extras/8abb0a5281ca47c8f1743b8ff4eb71a6.mp4?t=1743602461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the beast is caught in a trap, it can no longer use that leg properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t last long\u2014finish the fight before the trap breaks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all this incredible gameplay in online co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support us by adding to your wishlist and following the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
